MASTER PROMPT — AI AUTOMATED YOUTUBE CONTENT CREATOR

Project Goal

Build a complete, production-oriented Android application with a cloud backend for automated YouTube content creation, video editing, and publishing.

The app is initially designed for personal use by a single owner, but its architecture MUST be multi-user-ready from day one. Do not create an architecture that will require rewriting the application when more users are added.

The application should automate the complete process:

Topic Research → Script → Scene Breakdown → Video Footage Search → Download → Voice-over → Video Editing → Subtitles → Thumbnail → Title & Description → YouTube Upload → Scheduled Publishing

The goal is to minimize manual work. The user should be able to configure their preferences once and start automated video creation.

